{
"id": "fin-h-13",
"tier": "hard",
"topic": "Forecast",
"title": "Linear forecast for December (Sales)",
"context": "Fit a straight line of Sales actual against month number and extend it to month 12. Slope = CORREL × STDEV(y)/STDEV(x); intercept via the means.",
"task": "Return ROUND((12 − AVERAGE(x)) × CORREL(x, y) × STDEV.S(y) / STDEV.S(x) + AVERAGE(y), 0), where x = MONTH(FILTER(A2:A97, B2:B97=\"Sales\")) and y = FILTER(E2:E97, B2:B97=\"Sales\").",
"hint": "Regression slope = r × sy/sx.",
"answer": "=ROUND((12-AVERAGE(MONTH(FILTER(A2:A97,B2:B97=\"Sales\"))))*CORREL(MONTH(FILTER(A2:A97,B2:B97=\"Sales\")),FILTER(E2:E97,B2:B97=\"Sales\"))*STDEV.S(FILTER(E2:E97,B2:B97=\"Sales\"))/STDEV.S(MONTH(FILTER(A2:A97,B2:B97=\"Sales\")))+AVERAGE(FILTER(E2:E97,B2:B97=\"Sales\")),0)"
},
{
"id": "fin-h-14",
